  {
   "id": "note_scope",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1150,
   "y": 560,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**This board is the shape of the pathway, not a result.**\n\nEdges are relations from the literature and from curation, not measurements. For what this study found, see [[What this study found]]. The MG53 locus is deliberately absent: TRIM72's relation to FUS and PYCARD-AS1 is *position*, not regulation \u2014 see [[The TRIM72 locus]]."
  }
